# New app playbook

Source: sibling repo `docs/APP_STORE_LISTING_*.md`, `GOOGLE_PLAY_LISTING_*.md`, `AppConfig` (bundle ID, legal URLs).

Slug list / JSON-LD config: `lib/productApps.ts`. Add folder to `i18n.ts` `APPS`.

## Pre-launch

1. `lib/appPublishState.ts` → `{APP}_PUBLISHED = false`
2. `messages/apps/{slug}/en.json` — hero, download, privacy, terms
3. `app/[locale]/{slug}/` — layout uses `buildProductPageMetadata`; landing + legal
4. `sitemap.ts`: privacy + terms always; main path only if published
5. Skip home grid / `siteCatalog` until published (`robots: noindex` on landing if unpublished)

## Go live (Google + AI engines)

1. `{APP}_PUBLISHED = true`
2. Full page (benchmark: `hush-gallery`) + store badges
3. `lib/siteCatalog.ts`, `lib/productApps.ts`, home grid/carousel
4. `public/{slug}/faq.md`, expanded `public/llms.txt` bullet, `public/ai.txt` if new
5. `lib/appStructuredData.ts` Android ID; HTTP-check store URLs

Icon: `public/images/{slug}-icon.png` (512). Support: `zuki.apps.dev@gmail.com`.
Legal: `https://zukiapps.com/{slug}/privacy` and `/terms`.
